    reveal 1 other Spellcaster monster in your hand; you lose LP equal to the revealed
    monster''s Level x 300, and if you do, Special Summon this card. If this card
    is Special Summoned: You can add 1 Spell that mentions "Regulus, the Prince of
    Endymion" from your Deck to your hand.'
